# Game folders ship compiled/binary payloads that must never be touched by
# git's line-ending normalization. Without this, Windows git
# (core.autocrlf=true) silently converts CRLF -> LF while staging files,
# which previously corrupted Run3Source's text/*.txt level data (confirmed:
# every line lost exactly 1 byte, matching the file's line count exactly)
# and caused the compiled game to crash with "An unknown error occurred."
#
# The same hazard applies to Snow Rider's Unity WebGL export: the .unityweb
# files are compressed binaries and UnityLoader.js is a minified blob, so
# any byte-level rewrite makes the game fail to load.
snowrider-unblocked/** -text
